QUALITY BAR
Match the reference video's feel: the ring should read as light traveling around the edge, not a spinning sticker. Test on the deployed dark background specifically — the glow must be visible on #090909 without blooming. Verify 60fps (the animation must be compositor-friendly: only the custom property, opacity, and transform animate). Show me a before/after screenshot of the nav when done.